applicable law, Affirmant hereby overtly, fully, permanently,
irrevocably and unconditionally waives, abandons, and surrenders all of
Affirmant's Copyright and Related Rights and associated claims and causes
of action, whether now known or unknown (including existing as well as
future claims and causes of action), in the Work (i) in all territories
worldwide, (ii) for the maximum duration provided by applicable law or
treaty (including future time extensions), (iii) in any current or future
medium and for any number of copies, and (iv) for any purpose whatsoever,
including without limitation commercial, advertising or promotional purposes
(the "Waiver"). Affirmant makes the Waiver for the benefit of each member
of the public at large and to the detriment of Affirmant's heirs and
successors, fully intending that such Waiver not be subject to revocation,
cessation, suspension, termination, or any other legal or equitable
controlling action, and to be binding upon Affirmant's heirs and
successors, successors and assigns. This Waiver is made for the purpose of
giving the public clear, irrevocable, unconditional and unlimited access to
the Work free from any and all Copyright and Related Rights, and with the
knowledge that Public License Choices like CC0 are designed to give that
result. If Affirmant has not waived all Copyright and Related Rights,
the Waiver operates only to the extent of the statements made in this
CC0. To the extent necessary, Affirmant hereby also grants each recipient a
